1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,588
Why the questions first?

2
00:00:01,588 --> 00:00:05,820
A passage read without questions has to be remembered in full.

3
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:13,346
A passage read with five key words in your head is a search, and searching is about four times faster than remembering.

4
00:00:13,346 --> 00:00:17,291
This one change of order is worth two or three marks.

